  "prefLabel": "Env-A 3009.02 Injunctions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 3009.02 Injunctions. Any violation of Env-A 3009.01(a), Env-A 3009.01(b), or Env-A 3009.01(c) shall be subject to enforcement by injunction, including mandatory injunction, issued by the superior court upon application by the attorney general.\n\nSource. #6441, EXEMPT, eff 1-21-97",
